WEBVTT

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:08.360
Amen.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.108
I love you.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:50.240
There's been a lot of stand play lately.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.580
I always say this.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.220
What's important in team play is that

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.220
your allies cooperate and help each other out.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:58.840
Got it?

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:00.510
Yes.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:18.200
But...

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.540
I can't do this!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.810
I was called by Mr. Minerva.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:37.290
Minerva, excuse me.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.470
Minerva is passionate about Japanese dance.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:48.680
I was praised by Mr. Minerva for his good movement.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.470
I will definitely master Japanese traditional art.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.700
Of course, you have to master it.

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.400
That's what we master.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.880
You guys don't even have a piece of delicacy.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.840
It's the same as animals.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:06.460
What?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.120
Relax, relax. It's not an incident.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.460
Actually, an American diver wants to invite the three of us.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.620
I did it!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.700
Well, I hope you enjoy it.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:23.260
Hawkeye Diver Akaseru!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.300
You know how we feel!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.800
Oh, you two are in good shape.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:28.540
Yeah!

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:35.410
Hey, you little devil!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.910
They are the Cool Guys of the Abyssal Tribe.

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.910
In the past, this area was the powerhouse of the Jack Boys.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.980
So the leader was the Wilder?

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:00.610
That's right.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:05.190
On the other day, they got on.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.600
They are a great army.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:08.990
We are the将.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:19.160
The group will be killed next time.

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.560
I got caught up in the eye of the enemy.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.190
And I'm going to die.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.000
I swore I'd take revenge on you no matter what.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.320
And that's how I got them to challenge me.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.820
This guy is getting more and more interesting.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.350
You're not getting away with this.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:58.370
That's the end of the story.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:04:59.960
From now on...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.280
Special training.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.100
Training?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:02.850
Yes.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.510
Special training to maximize the power given to us.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.760
I thought there would be one.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.830
I got caught by a fork.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.710
I heard about it.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.270
Well, that's about it.

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.380
Don't forget the power of soccer's dribbling!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:34.350
Alright!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:35.440
Question!

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.240
Alright, next is Cab.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:22.980
Let's get started!

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:48.720
The handling is bad.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:50.570
From now on, practice the shooter three times.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.020
Yes, sir.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:54.440
Next, Minerva.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.960
If you lose, you'll have to take the next step.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:56.560
Minerva's Shock Blaster only makes the enemy not move for 60 seconds.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.980
If this is a real battle, how many lives will it take?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.900
It's not enough even if there are six of us.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.480
Yes.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:08.560
I'm confident in my emergency activities, but not in combat.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.280
It's okay. Leave the battle to us.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.260
Right, Kyabu?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.210
That's right.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.040
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.860
I'm going to investigate the accident of the underwater volcano,

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.180
so I'd like to ask for a leave of absence from the research institute.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.140
Yes, please leave it to us.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.580
What's wrong, Minerva?

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:27.900
There is no excuse for Master Force.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:30.560
Hang in there.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.710
I'm counting on you.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:38.390
Suits on!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:15.590
It's here!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:30.560
Three of us?

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:32.650
Three of us isn't enough, is it?

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:37.730
You say you have good luck, but if you tell me, you're an idiot.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:40.510
Three of us are more than enough for a coward like you.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.460
What? You bastard!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:44.710
Everyone, fight!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.130
What's going on with them?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.290
Well then, we've taken care of the rascals.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.580
Yes, sir!

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:20.980
As you ordered, we'll pay you back for what you've done!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:21.440
Anything but that!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.640
Don't you dare talk to me like that!

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.900
I'll pay you back twice as much as I owe you!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:38.400
Wilder, go wilder! Go wilder!

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:42.380
Use the power we, the Decepticons, have given you to attract the boys.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:48.620
If you do that, there will be more and more people supporting the Decepticons.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.560
I understand.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.410
And don't forget.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:56.480
When the headmaster of the Autobots appears, you don't need to hesitate.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.160
Let them know of your power.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:30.820
Heh, fine!

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.250
Heh, heh!

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:33.170
N-Nyudo!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:34.970
Stop being so dumb and call the others!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:36.670
H-Hey!

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:49.300
You're a wild boar!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:00.780
Damn it!

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:01.340
Wait!

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:05.140
I'm going to get them out of here!

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.140
I'm going to get them out of here!

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.940
We're the Master Force of Cybertron!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.490
If we rely on Hawks and Divers,

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.630
we won't be able to become a single person!

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:17.770
But our mission is to rescue them!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.660
That's why we can't just watch them rampage!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.000
I'm going!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:24.680
Shoot!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:26.260
Master Force!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:40.000
I won't let Shuta get away with it!

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.100
No! Let's go to the Diver!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:45.580
Shut up, Diver! Diver!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.980
Oh, right! Minerva is scared of fighting!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:49.460
Right?

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.340
We can take care of the fight!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:53.910
See you!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.640
If you don't want to die, you don't need to die.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:26.220
I need you.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:28.180
Take it.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.100
You don't know that?

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.160
Shut up!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.390
What do you know about those who grew up with their parents?

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.830
That's right! We want to do whatever we want with the power Decepticons gave us!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.920
Shut up! Let's beat them up!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.280
Take a closer look at how powerful we are!

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:18.940
Yes, sir!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:26.900
Take this!

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:30.580
Thank you.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:27.550
It's fun to have a big mouth, isn't it?

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:49.370
Then I don't know.

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:54.590
Where is my master?

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.950
No idea.

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:03.760
Yes, I got it. It's the parking lot!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:11.530
Who are they?

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.670
Oh, is his friend nearby?

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.380
Yes, I saw him in the city.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:41.040
All right, come on, Robclaw!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.490
I'll give you a hard time!

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:04.500
You guys, let's go!

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:06.670
Are you going to leave him behind?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.170
Shut up and follow me!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:21.460
He's the one who told me where you were.

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:29.740
What a woman!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.980
It's a girl in the headmaster jr.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.580
There was a girl in the headmaster jr.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.190
Okay, let's do it!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:50.200
So, let's go!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.750
Hey, you're a dog!

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:19.440
You can't say no to the Master Force.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.300
I won't forgive you!

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:47.440
I'll pay you back for what you've done to me!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.740
Wait for me, brother!

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:49.240
Don't leave me!

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.050
Take us with you!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:13.990
Leave it to me!

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.480
I'm going to give you a puppy that looks like Piss.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:47.740
Really?

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.860
Yes. So cheer up.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.580
Minerva has successfully transformed herself.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:58.770
For you, strength and courage are the strongest weapons.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:01.550
Well, for Minerva's sake,

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.530
we'll have to watch a lot of Shuta and Cab's stand-up games.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:05.990
That's right!

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:06.870
That's better!

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:08.130
You guys!

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:13.360
In the battle with Headmaster Jr. from Destron,

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:16.240
Minerva fought back against her own weakness.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:21.280
And Shuta and Cab also woke up to the importance of teamwork,

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.620
and were able to instill the courage to fight against evil.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.500
The Wilders have been forced to separate their brother and sister.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:44.030
The purpose is not to choose a way.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.600
I won't forgive those who trample on my heart!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.570
Here I go!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:51.840
Next time on Transformers! Super Master Force!

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.400
Go! Ghost Shooter!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.060
The Battle of Koya!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:59.560
Now, Master Force! You too, Tran!

00:22:30.316 --> 00:22:30.816
Oh, boy.
